==History==
===Ben 10===
*Four Arms first appeared in ''[[Washington B.C.]]'', where he defeated [[Dr. Animo (Classic)|Dr. Animo]]'s [[Living Mammoth]] by spinning it until it fell apart. Then, he tried to save [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] from the [[Mutant Parrot]], but ended up being overturned and timed out.
*In ''[[The Krakken]]'', Four Arms pretended to be a sea monster to scare Gwen. He was then attacked by the [[Krakken]] but escaped it and ran scared to the [[Rustbucket (Classic)|Rustbucket]] to warn [[Max Tennyson|Max]] and Gwen, but they didn't believe him.
*In ''[[Kevin 11 (Episode)|Kevin 11]]'', Four Arms jumped across the streets of [[New York City]] and went to the overpass where [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] was attacking a street gang. Later, he grabbed Kevin, who absorbed his DNA and transformed into a [[Kevin's Tetramand Mutation|Tetramand hybrid]]. The two fought, but Four Arms managed to defeat him just before reverting to [[Human (Classic)|human]].
*In ''[[Tourist Trap]]'', Four Arms played with the rubber ball containing the [[Nosedeenian (Classic)|Megawhatt]], but accidentally dropped it, causing it to damage the place, consequently freeing the Megawhatt. He was scolded by Gwen, who slapped him. He promised to put everything in its place, but timed out before he could do so.
*In ''[[The Alliance]]'', Four Arms fought [[Rojo]], [[Rojo's Gang|her gang]] and [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]]'s [[Mechadroid|Mechadroids]], but hesitated when he realized that Rojo's gang were women, causing Max to get injured. Then, he abandoned the fight to take Gwen and an injured Max to the hospital.
*In ''[[Lucky Girl (Episode)|Lucky Girl]]'', Four Arms tried to save some people at a museum, freed Gwen from some branches, battled the stone statues that [[Hex (Classic)|Hex]] had brought to life, and threw the latter into a coffin.
*In ''[[Side Effects]]'', Four Arms, with a cold, pretended to be a giant bug to scare Gwen. He then "saved" [[Ms. Liang]], spitting slime on her body and preventing poisonous black widow spiders from attacking her and accidentally destroyed [[Clancy]]'s home while being attacked by ants.
*In ''[[Secrets]]'', [[Wildmutt]] unintentionally transformed into Four Arms due to an [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] malfunction. He destroyed Vilgax's machine and was about to destroy a Mechadroid before the malfunctioning Omnitrix switched him into [[Ghostfreak]].
**Also, Four Arms appeared as one of the many alien templates used for Vilgax's army in an imaginary sequence.
*In ''[[The Big Tick]]'', Four Arms was the first alien that Ben used to try to destroy the [[Great One]], making him punch him to try to penetrate his shell, but was unsuccessful.
*In ''[[Framed]]'', [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]] as Four Arms rampaged in a street of San Francisco, destroying much of it and fighting the police and [[Lt. Steel]], making Gwen and Max believe he was Ben. Later, Ben spotted him in an alley and chased him until he reached the mint. At night, on the Golden Gate Bridge, Ben as Four Arms defeated Kevin as [[Diamondhead (Classic)|Diamondhead]], [[Heatblast (Classic)|Heatblast]] and was attacked by [[Stinkfly (Classic)|Stinkfly]] before Kevin reverted. Four Arms threatened to punch the defenseless Kevin, but abandoned him, saying that he had already defeated him and that he was wasn't worth it. Kevin mutated into [[Kevin 11]] and attacked Four Arms, almost knocking him off the bridge, but was hit by a missile and fell into the sea. Four Arms saved [[Lt. Steel|Steel]], agreeing to leave him alone before jumping away.
*In ''[[The Galactic Enforcers]]'', Four Arms fought [[SixSix (Classic)|SixSix]] and [[Vulkanus]], where [[Tini]] flirted with him. He helped her save a falling building. Tini asked what a [[Tetramand (Classic)|Tetramand]] was doing on [[Earth (Classic)|Earth]] before Four Arms timed out, to [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]'s delight.
*In ''[[Grudge Match]]'', Four Arms briefly battled [[Technorg]] before he and Kevin 11 were taken to [[Slix Vigma]] and tied together. The two of them then battled Technorg again until Four Arms reverted.
*In ''[[Ghostfreaked Out]]'', Four Arms battled [[Zs'Skayr]] and the [[Circus Freaks (Classic)|Circus Freaks]] and was forced to fight Gwen when she was possessed by Zs'Skayr.
*In ''[[Ultimate Weapon]]'', Four Arms saved Gwen and Max from falling, scolded Max for being obsessed with the mission and battled [[Ah Puch]].
*In ''[[Tough Luck]]'', Four Arms saved a bus of elderly people from falling off a cliff. When he was about to leave, he was reprimanded for not getting them off the bus and had to listen to a story from one of the elderly people there.
*In ''[[Back With a Vengeance]]'', Four Arms appeared three times. Firstly, he was seen in a photo. Later, he briefly fought [[Vilgax (Classic)|Vilgax]] and [[Kevin 11]] before switching into [[XLR8 (Classic)|XLR8]] to save Max and Gwen. Lastly in the [[Null Void (Classic)|Null Void]], Four Arms defeated Vilgax's [[Null Guardian]].
*In ''[[Game Over]]'', Four Arms defended himself from [[Ishiyama]] within ''[[Sumo Slammer Smackdown]]''.
*In ''[[Super Alien Hero Buddy Adventures (Episode)|Super Alien Hero Buddy Adventures]]'', Four Arms helped [[Abel North]] save some people from a falling rollercoaster.
*In ''[[Under Wraps]]'', Four Arms tried to milk some cows.
*In ''[[Monster Weather]]'', Four Arms battled [[S.A.M.]] to no avail until he realized that his only weakness is the loud noise of a guitar.
*In ''[[The Unnaturals]]'', Four Arms defeated the [[Squires]] and [[Coach Finn]].
*In ''[[The Visitor]]'', Four Arms fought the Mechadroid.
*In ''[[Perfect Day]]'', Four Arms defeated Vilgax, sent him to the Null Void and discovered the truth behind his perfect day in a dream.
*In ''[[Don't Drink the Water]]'', 4-year-old Four Arms escaped the police.
*In ''[[Ready to Rumble]]'', Four Arms was used for a wrestling tournament and defeated the [[Immovable Object]], a wrestler with lobster-like features, [[Porcupine]] and [[Gaterboy]].
*In ''[[Ben 10 vs. Negative 10: Part 2]]'', Four Arms battled the [[Negative 10]].
*In ''[[Hijacked]]'', Four Arms stopped the [[Convict|convict]] and [[Frank]] from stealing the [[Rustbucket (Classic)|Rustbucket]].
*In '''''[[Ben 10: Secret of the Omnitrix]]''''', Four Arms failed to save Gwen from a [[Florauna (Classic)|Florauna]] tribe.
*In '''''[[Ben 10: Destroy All Aliens]]''''', Four Arms appeared twice. Firstly, Four Arms attacked Ben in a dream. Then, Four Arms battled [[Azmuth's Father|Retaliator]] until the [[Omnitrix (Original)|Omnitrix]] switched him into [[Upgrade (Classic)|Upgrade]].
*In ''[[Destroy All Aliens]]'', Four Arms traversed [[Petropia (Classic)|Petropia]] with Gwen.
*In ''[[Road Trip Rumble]]'', Four Arms fought Gwen in order to decide whether the Omnitrix or [[Magic (Classic)|magic]] is better until Gwen accidentally switched him into Upgrade.
*In ''[[The Forge of Creation]]'', Four Arms was defeated by Ultimate Aggregor before his older self switched him into [[Stinkfly (Classic)|Stinkfly]].

