====[[Ben 10 (2006 Video Game)|Ben 10]]====
Four Arms is a playable alien in the game.

====[[Ben 10: Protector of Earth]]====
Four Arms is one of the first aliens available. He also has unlockable Dark Heroes and DNA Force skin. His special attack (which involves throwing a rock at his opponent) is the most powerful out of all the other playable characters in the game.

====[[Ben 10 Ultimate Alien: Cosmic Destruction]]====
Four Arms is an exclusive alien for the PS3 version of the game. Four Arms can be unlocked by either completing the game or by entering the cheat code, "classic".

Since he is treated as an exclusive alien to a certain console, Four Arms is not required to be used at all in order to complete the game.

====[[Ben 10: Galactic Racing]]====
Four Arms is a playable racer in the game for the console and 3DS versions of the game.

====[[Punch Time Explosion XL]]====
Four Arms is the "Punch Time Explosion" attack and "Synergy Attacks" for [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Young Ben]].

====[[Ben 10: Omniverse (Video Game)|Ben 10: Omniverse]]====
Four Arms is a playable alien in the game (by both 11-year-old and 16-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]]).

====[[Ben 10: Omniverse 2]]====
Four Arms is a playable alien in the game.

