====[[FusionFall]]====
The Four Arms Nano is a miniature version of Four Arms that supports the player in ''[[FusionFall]]''. It is obtained by completing a Nano mission "Plant Problems" by defeating [[Fusion Max]] and obtain an alien barbell to create said Nano.

=====Powers and Abilities=====
*Four Hand Grab (Scavenge) - Four Arms collects more Fusion Matter.
*Overpower (Leech - Point) - Four Arms weakens enemies and makes player stronger.
*Seeing Red (Sleep - Self Area) - Four Arms knocks out enemies.

====[[Project Exonaut]]====
Four Arms is a playable Exosuit of the Atlas Brigade on Project Exonaut. His Weapon Mod increases the speed of the Ballista. Four Arms is available for purchase at Level 30 for 2000 coins.

====[[Super Hero Time]]====
Four Arms is a playable alien in the game.

