==Trivia==
*Four Arms is one of [[Ken Tennyson|Ken]]'s favorite aliens.<ref name="Ken 10" />
*Four Arms is the first alien used by 11-year-old [[Ben Tennyson (Classic)|Ben]] in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]'''.
*[[John DiMaggio]]'s voice for 10-year-old Four Arms in '''[[Ben 10: Ultimate Alien (TV Series)|Ultimate Alien]]''' was an imitation of Richard McGonagle's performance. Since '''Omniverse''', however, John uses a more generic deeper voice for both 11-year-old and 16-year-old Four Arms.
*Four Arms needs twice as much deodorant as a [[Human (Classic)|human]].{{Refn|''[[Ghostfreaked Out]]''; [https://preservetube.com/watch?v&#61;x_lycH63x3s link]|group = AC|name = GO}}<ref name="GO" />
*Four Arms' [[Transformation Sequences|transformation sequence]] was the first one to be designed.{{Refn|group = AC|name = GO}}<ref name="GO" />
*During '''Alien Force''' and '''Ultimate Alien''', [[Dwayne McDuffie]] and [[Glen Murakami]] sometimes gave suggestions to the writers on which aliens Ben should use in each episode, to prevent [[Humungousaur (Classic)|Humungousaur]] and Four Arms from appearing too frequently.{{Refn|[[:File:Dwayne and Glen Suggested Other Aliens.png]]|group = DM}}
*Four Arms was created by [[Joe Casey]].{{Refn|https://preservetube.com/watch?v&#61;kU5Lz7cnK-g|group = JC}}
*Four Arms was first envisioned as a superhero named [[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)/Early Development#StrongGuy|StrongGuy]]. [[Dave Johnson]] designed Four Arms for the '''[[Ben 10 (2005 TV Series)|Original Series]]'''.{{Refn|https://archive.is/LWv9i|group = DJ|name = greenlit}}
**Four Arms is Dave's favorite alien because he was the first one to get approved for the '''Original Series'''.{{Refn|[[:File:Dave's Favorite Alien.PNG]]|group = DJ}}
**The design that was greenlit had few changes from Dave's original sketch,{{Refn|group = DJ|name = greenlit}} the most important one being that he had to make the secondary arms smaller than the primary arms so that they would not jut out.{{Refn|[[:File:OS Four Arms Design No Inspiration.png]]|group = DJ|name = Inspiration}}
**Dave did not take inspiration from pre-existing characters when drawing Four Arms.{{Refn|name=Inspiration|group = DJ}}
*Concept art for Four Arms in '''[[Ben 10: Omniverse (TV Series)|Omniverse]]''' originally featured a pair of jutting incisors, a different outfit equipped with shoulder pads and the Omnitrix symbol on his chest.{{Refn|[[:File:Echo Echo & Four Arms Concept Art by Derrick J. Wyatt.png]]|group = ca}} Someone other than [[Derrick J. Wyatt]] made the final model based on his roughs.{{Refn|[[:File:OV Four Arms Based on Derrick's Concepts.png]]|group = DJW}}
*Four Arms was originally supposed to have a larger role in ''[[Couples Retreat]]''. After [[Gwen Tennyson (Classic)|Gwen]] summoned the [[Door to Anywhere]], Ben would have transformed into him in an attempt to open it along with [[Kevin Levin (Classic)|Kevin]], to no avail.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/e/ef/Couples_Retreat_Draft-1.pdf ''Couples Retreat'' Script First Draft]|group = script|name = script 1}}
*Four Arms was initially not supposed to appear in:
**''[[Escape From Aggregor]]'', with his role taken by Humungousaur.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/6/60/EFA_Script_Outline.pdf ''Escape From Aggregor'' Script Outline]|group = outline}}
**''[[Moonstruck]]'', with his role taken by Swampfire.{{Refn|[https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/ben10/images/f/ff/Moonstruck_Script_Outline.pdf ''Moonstruck'' Script Outline]|group = outline|name = outline}}
*Four Arms was initially planned to be one of the playable aliens in the ''[[Game Creator]]'', but was soon removed from the game entirely when '''[[Ben 10: Alien Force (TV Series)|Alien Force]]''' aired.
*[[Richard McGonagle]] considers Four Arms to be his toughest cartoon role, stating that he sounds like he had just gargled glass.{{Refn|https://preservetube.com/watch?v&#61;ISkm6iBb42Q|group = RM|name = YT}}
**[[Nolan North]] auditioned to voice Four Arms in the '''Original Series''', but lost the role to Richard.
*Four Arms is one of [[Joe Kelly]]'s favorite aliens.{{Refn|group = JK|https://twitter.com/yasinemiralkaya/status/1771639134660055254}}

